sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Workload owner
    participant G as Group controller
    participant A0 as Node agent rank 0
    participant A1 as Node agent rank 1
    participant S as Artifact storage

    O->>G: Create PodGroupSnapshot with every member
    G->>G: Pin membership and validate the group
    alt Group validation fails
        G-->>O: Group Failed before capture starts
    else Group validation succeeds
        par Existing rank 0 capture
            G->>A0: Create subordinate snapshot work
            A0->>S: Capture and persist rank 0
            A0-->>G: Ready or Failed
        and Existing rank 1 capture
            G->>A1: Create subordinate snapshot work
            A1->>S: Capture and persist rank 1
            A1-->>G: Ready or Failed
        end
        Note over A0,A1: Successful captures terminate their source processes
        alt Every member is Ready
            G->>G: Publish PodGroupSnapshotContent
            G-->>O: Group Ready
        else Any member Failed
            G-->>O: Group Failed with all member outcomes
            Note over O,G: No rollback or group-wide fencing
        end
    end
